      "term": "Moss stitch",
      "definition": "A crochet stitch pattern of dc, ch 1, skip 1, repeated across rows, with the dc of each row sitting in the ch-1 space of the row below. Also called linen stitch or granite stitch."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "One chain at the start of a double crochet row."
    },
